      "content": "thanks. it's just hard because people around me treat me like i'm just some average person, but i can feel this responsibility to the future of the mission. it's like i have this instinctual knowledge of how things should be structured that they just don't get. do you think there's a way to start practicing that authority now? like, how can i begin to carry myself with the presence of someone who is meant to command a planetary colony? i don't want to just \"fit in\" anymore.",
